    {
      "text": "六英雄自动战斗，重生后可在后台全员管理",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your heroes automatically move, attack, heal, and perform other actions, ensuring nonstop battles! By progressing through Rebirth , you can eventually manage all heroes simultaneously in the background.",
